{"id":"cc4e938a01248a42","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-projective-enumeration.md","title":"Projective Enumeration Theorem","display":"thm-projective-enumeration — Projective Enumeration Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-projective-enumeration","aliases":["68-thm-projective-enumeration"],"display":"thm-projective-enumeration — Projective Enumeration Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","[[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"20.1 p.75 / PDF 84","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read-and-correspondence-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-projective-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-projective-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-projective-enumeration — Projective Enumeration Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"612c45683cbbc89b\" href=\"?note=612c45683cbbc89b\" title=\"68-df-real-parameter-enumeration\">68-df-real-parameter-enumeration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"20.1 p.75 / PDF 84"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read-and-correspondence-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。无参数解析类及带实参数投射类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"150b567749c83f49\" href=\"?note=150b567749c83f49\" title=\"68-df-projective-hierarchy\">68-df-projective-hierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"612c45683cbbc89b\" href=\"?note=612c45683cbbc89b\" title=\"68-df-real-parameter-enumeration\">68-df-real-parameter-enumeration</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(Q,\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(Q,\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists U\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(U,\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists U\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(U,\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项核对 20.1。原书先把 RE in R 关系所用的有限实参数及一个自然数程序索引编码进单个实数，再用 §18 的通用计算关系；添加交替实量词前缀得到各正层级的通用关系。Q、U 自身无固定外加实参数，但用任意实切片覆盖粗体类。这里记录书中证明路线，未把它声称为 Coq/Rocq 机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-real-parameter-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"612c45683cbbc89b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-projective-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$。无参数解析类及带实参数投射类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]；$\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-real-parameter-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"612c45683cbbc89b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$。无参数解析类及带实参数投射类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]；$\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-real-parameter-enumeration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(Q,\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists U\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\operatorname{REnum}_{m,k}(U,\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true}],"bytes":1508,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a4f932ed500c2b4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$\\mathcal B$ 和正层级投射类沿用 [[68-thm-projective-enumeration]] 的定义。$X_{1,0}$ 与 $\\mathcal B$ 通过 $(\\langle\\alpha\\rangle,())\\leftrightarrow\\alpha$ 识别。"},{"id":"94e1d47d7b40b77a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-enumeration]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-enumeration|thm-projective-enumeration — Projective Enumeration Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["150b567749c83f49","612c45683cbbc89b"]}